Package: entropy-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Maintainer: jegly <jegly@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jegly/entropy
Description: GTK4 + libadwaita front-end for the entropy random data generator
 Entropy GUI drives jegly/entropy (a cryptographically secure random data
 generator) as a subprocess and adds live progress, cancellation, Shannon
 entropy analysis, byte-frequency visualization, and a Tesseract-style
 theme engine with 20 built-in palettes.
 .
 The generator CLI itself is vendored unmodified at
 /usr/lib/entropy-gui/entropy_gui/vendor/entropy.py -- this package never
 reimplements its logic, only wraps it.
